  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.28 \"Skills evaluation\" means the basic or experienced rider course range evaluation to be completed by each student in order to successfully pass the motorcycle rider education program course.\n\nSource. #10589, eff 5-14-14 (from Saf-C 5301.27); ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.27)",
